.honua
artifacts
**/bin
**/obj
test-results
*.user
*.log

# Operator secrets. `.gitignore` does not apply to Docker build contexts, so without
# these the documented `./scripts/bootstrap-operator-env.sh` output (.env.local, which
# holds provider and backend API keys) would be sent to the builder and retained in the
# build-stage layer cache even though the final stage copies only the executable.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
